{"id":"vod_bf_17589","vodId":"17589","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"JOJO的奇妙冒险","name_cn":"JOJO的奇妙冒险","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/3b562cc3c61bffdca0080c2b091d7fd7.jpg"},"summary":"在一次意外中，乔纳森（兴津和幸 配音）的父亲乔斯达爵士（菅原正志 配音）被陌生少年迪奥布兰度（子安武人 配音）所救，善良的爵士收留了自称无依无靠的迪奥，后者则以养子的身份正式进入了乔斯达家族的大门。在他人的眼中，迪奥是一个优秀正直的少年，可是，只有经历过迪奥残酷欺辱的乔 纳森才知道，在迪奥光鲜的面具后面，隐藏着一颗邪恶的心。 果不其然，随着年龄的增长，迪奥开始觊觎起了乔斯达家族的庞大家产。无意间，迪奥发现了能够使人变得强大的石鬼面具，为了获得更多的财富和权力，迪奥毫不犹豫的带上了面具。在成为了恐怖的吸血鬼后，迪奥开始了对乔斯达家族的疯狂报复。为了替父亲和整个家族报仇，乔纳森开始修炼唯一能够打败吸血鬼的波纹气功，面对着强大的敌人及其党羽，乔纳森能够获得最终的胜利吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 05:22:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/JOJOdeqimiaomaoxian/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbb